{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Hear, O sons</b> — After he admonished his son, he reproved other sons, that they should heed their father's discipline, even though they are tender; to their father he is accounted like me."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The referent of 'he' (the speaker of Proverbs) and the precise sense of 'like me' are ambiguous; translated hyper-literally without resolving."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:59.235638464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}